OL,3,AWill you get #13,000 a year when you
OL,4,Astop working? Here's how to check
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt may well be decades away, but do you
OL,7,Fknow how much money you will get when
OL,8,Fyou stop working?
OL,10,FThe current state pension is soon
OL,11,Flikely to top #13,000 a year.
OL,13,FYet one in eight people surveyed by the
OL,14,FUK tax authority have never checked how
OL,15,Fmuch money they are forecast to
OL,16,Freceive.
OL,18,FHere's how to find out, and what you
OL,19,Fcan do now to boost it.
